Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: C++ qpOASES active-set solver wrapper (marinholab)
 The marinholab-solvers-qpoases C++ package provides the ROS-independent
 C++ part of the solver-qpoases project: the marinholab::solvers::qpoases
 namespace with the Solver (an online active-set quadratic-program solver
 wrapping qpOASES' QPSolver) and its Configuration option holder.
 .
 It is built with CMake (with -O3) and exposes the CMake target
 marinholab::solvers::qpoases. The qpOASES dependency (coin-or/qpOASES) is
 vendored as a git submodule and installed into the same package. The
 pybind11 Python extension is intentionally NOT part of this package; it is
 produced by `pip install .` from the same source tree.
